    {
      "index": "ov-about",
      "component_type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "workflow_tag": "",
      "data_collection_tag": "",
      "wf_id": null,
      "dc_id": null,
      "dc_config": {},
      "cols_json": {},
      "parent_index": null,
      "last_updated": "2026-08-29T00:00:00.000000",
      "title_align": "left",
      "section": null,
      "order": 1,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "### About this dashboard\nnf-core/viralrecon aligns each sample's reads to the viral reference, calls its variants, builds a consensus genome and names its lineage. This page sums up one run; each tab behind it answers one question, in the order of the steps below.\n\nThe sample filters in the left panel apply to every tab: narrow the samples once and the whole dashboard follows. A bar above a section narrows that section only.\n",
      "surface": "card",
      "accent": null,
      "logo": null,
      "logo_dark": null
    },
    {
      "index": "ov-run",
      "component_type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "workflow_tag": "",
      "data_collection_tag": "",
      "wf_id": null,
      "dc_id": null,
      "dc_config": {},
      "cols_json": {},
      "parent_index": null,
      "last_updated": "2026-08-29T00:00:00.000000",
      "title_align": "left",
      "section": null,
      "order": 1,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "### The run\n- ![](icon:mdi:flask-outline) **Samples** {{samples}}\n- ![](icon:mdi:chip) **Platform** {{param:platform}} \u00b7 {{param:protocol}}\n- ![](icon:mdi:virus-outline) **Reference** {{param:genome}}\n- ![](icon:mdi:dna) **Primers** {{param:primer_set}} v{{param:primer_set_version}}\n- ![](icon:mdi:tune) **Callers** {{param:variant_caller}} \u00b7 {{param:consensus_caller}}\n",
      "surface": "card",
      "accent": null,
      "logo": null,
      "logo_dark": null,
      "values": {
        "samples": {
          "dc": "summary_metrics",
          "column": "sample",
          "aggregation": "nunique",
          "format": "integer",
          "wf_id": {
            "$oid": "746b0f3c1e4a2d7f8e5b9c01"
          },
          "dc_id": {
