    {
      "index": "ov-steps",
      "component_type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "workflow_tag": "",
      "data_collection_tag": "",
      "wf_id": null,
      "dc_id": null,
      "dc_config": {},
      "cols_json": {},
      "parent_index": null,
      "last_updated": "2026-08-29T00:00:00.000000",
      "title_align": "left",
      "section": null,
      "order": 1,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "### Six steps from reads to lineages\nEach step names its settings and the tab that shows its result.\n\n::: steps\n1. ![](icon:mdi:content-cut) **Trim** Adapters cut by fastp \u00b7 [Settings](params:fastp) \u00b7 [MultiQC](tab:MultiQC)\n2. ![](icon:mdi:target) **Align** Bowtie 2, primers clipped by iVar \u00b7 [Settings](params:ivar_trim) \u00b7 [Sample QC](tab:Sample QC)\n3. ![](icon:mdi:chart-areaspline) **Cover** Depth by mosdepth \u00b7 [Settings](params:mosdepth) \u00b7 [Coverage](tab:Coverage & Depth)\n4. ![](icon:mdi:dna) **Call** Variants by {{param:variant_caller}}, effects by snpEff \u00b7 [Settings](params:variant) \u00b7 [Variants](tab:Variants)\n5. ![](icon:mdi:source-merge) **Consensus** One genome per sample \u00b7 [Settings](params:consensus) \u00b7 [Sample QC](tab:Sample QC)\n6. ![](icon:mdi:virus) **Type** Pangolin lineage, Nextclade clade \u00b7 [Settings](params:nextclade) \u00b7 [Lineages](tab:Lineage & Clustering)\n:::\n",
      "surface": "card",
      "accent": "green",
      "logo": null,
      "logo_dark": null
    },
