      "order": 1,
      "alignment": "left",
      "vertical_alignment": "center",
      "body": "- **{{n_good}}** of {{n_cons}} consensus genomes rated good by Nextclade \u2013 the rest are mediocre or bad [Sample QC](tab:Sample QC)\n- **{{n_low}}** of {{n_amp}} amplicons fall under 10x in at least one sample \u2013 that stretch of its consensus is masked [Coverage](tab:Coverage & Depth)\n- **{{n_mis}}** of {{n_calls}} variant calls change an amino acid \u2013 missense, by snpEff [Variants](tab:Variants)\n- **{{top_share}}** of the assigned samples are {{top}} \u2013 the most common Pangolin lineage [Lineages](tab:Lineage & Clustering)\n",
      "surface": "card",
      "accent": null,
      "logo": null,
      "logo_dark": null,
      "values": {
        "n_good": {
          "dc": "nextclade_results",
          "column": "sample",
          "aggregation": "count",
          "filter_expr": "col('qc_overallStatus') == 'good'",
          "format": "integer",
          "wf_id": {
            "$oid": "746b0f3c1e4a2d7f8e5b9c01"
          },
          "dc_id": {
